ingredients:
- 2 cups (240g) King Arthur Unbleached All-Purpose Flour
- 1 cup (113g) King Arthur Golden Wheat Flour
- 1 tablespoon (14g) baking powder
- 1/2 teaspoon baking soda
- 3/4 teaspoon table salt
- 2 to 8 tablespoons (28g to 113g) butter, (to taste; the more, the richer)
- 1 teaspoon to 4 tablespoons granulated sugar, to taste
- 1 cup (227g) buttermilk, or a combination of plain yogurt and milk; or liquid whey
- coarse sparkling sugar, for sprinkling on top, optional
